## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo

## Rider / VS / VS Code
.vs/
.idea/
## The contents rather than the directory itself: git never looks inside an ignored
## directory, so a negation below it would have no effect.
.vscode/*

## ...except the two files that tell every contributor how to run this, rather than
## leaving each editor to generate its own — a generated one commonly points at a port
## nothing here listens on.
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

## Local databases (development only)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

## Local media storage (development only)
media-storage/

## Secrets — never commit; use user-secrets or environment variables
appsettings.*.Local.json
secrets.json
.env

## OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
